  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Develop data services on deforestation risk in commodity value chains for financial investors</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The aim of this project is to develop data services on deforestation risk in commodity value chains for financial investors, to make them invest in deforestation risk free commodity value chains. The goal is to reduce deforestation in rainforest countries.</narrative>
  </description>
